Link Quality Fabric

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs.

Link Quality Fabric is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for evidence-backed
signal, error, degradation and quality state beyond binary link up/down. It
reports the quality state a link, generation, interval and evidence set actually
support, what changed, and how certain and fresh that conclusion is.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Link Quality Fabric does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All state is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Link Quality Fabric accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on
